347
00:11:55,920 --> 00:11:57,199
what kind of look he gives,

348
00:11:57,200 --> 00:11:58,920
what kind of body language he has...

349
00:11:59,160 --> 00:12:00,120
In that regard,

350
00:12:00,121 --> 00:12:01,599
your challenge is actually greater.

351
00:12:01,600 --> 00:12:03,039
So in terms of performance,

352
00:12:03,040 --> 00:12:04,599
there was indeed a lot of pressure.

353
00:12:04,600 --> 00:12:06,959
Because I think later on, you were completely playing yourself.

354
