361
00:12:19,280 --> 00:12:21,200
That might be more captivating.

362
00:12:22,160 --> 00:12:23,679
Now, an introvert playing an extrovert

363
00:12:23,680 --> 00:12:25,560
can actually more easily capture those

364
00:12:25,880 --> 00:12:27,679
behavioral traits and details,

365
00:12:27,680 --> 00:12:30,520
because extroverts are more expressive, right?

366
00:12:30,760 --> 00:12:32,159
So I think your performance still

367
00:12:32,160 --> 00:12:33,679
made me feel like you were acting him.

368
00:12:33,680 --> 00:12:34,440
Especially I think

369
00:12:34,441 --> 00:12:36,239
when you just came into the makeup room,

370
00:12:36,240 --> 00:12:38,559
