371
00:12:38,560 --> 00:12:39,639
Just being cocky.

372
00:12:39,640 --> 00:12:42,399
How do I check my eye makeup or something?

373
00:12:42,400 --> 00:12:42,800
Right.

374
00:12:42,800 --> 00:12:43,640
It's that when we perform

375
00:12:43,641 --> 00:12:45,119
We often hope to

376
00:12:45,120 --> 00:12:46,439
focus on some details

377
00:12:46,440 --> 00:12:48,359
Because details are what make it delicate and real.

378
00:12:48,360 --> 00:12:50,399
