379
00:12:50,400 --> 00:12:52,520
So I encourage and support this.

380
00:12:53,080 --> 00:12:55,720
I actually really want to thank my partner.

381
00:12:56,000 --> 00:12:57,999
Although I've never expressed it to him.

382
00:12:58,000 --> 00:12:59,000
Because I feel these words

383
00:12:59,000 --> 00:12:59,920
sound really pretentious,

384
00:12:59,921 --> 00:13:01,799
especially for introverts like me.

385
00:13:01,800 --> 00:13:03,639
Opening up requires a way

386
