387
00:13:05,440 --> 00:13:07,359
And this happened to become that stimulus.

388
00:13:07,360 --> 00:13:08,200
I'm very grateful to him.

389
00:13:08,201 --> 00:13:10,239
When we were grouped

390
00:13:10,240 --> 00:13:11,559
we ended up in the same group.

391
00:13:11,560 --> 00:13:12,919
Produced such a

392
00:13:12,920 --> 00:13:14,960
