398
00:13:30,240 --> 00:13:31,840
The personality I wrote for him:

399
00:13:32,240 --> 00:13:35,599
Sunny, warm, careful, considerate.

400
00:13:35,600 --> 00:13:36,959
But sensitive inside.

401
00:13:36,960 --> 00:13:38,240
