407
00:13:50,600 --> 00:13:52,839
Hello everyone, I'm Chen Zhixuan.

408
00:13:52,840 --> 00:13:53,520
In everyone's eyes,

409
00:13:53,521 --> 00:13:55,319
I am a gentle, considerate, sunny boy,

410
00:13:55,320 --> 00:13:58,120
