413
00:14:02,160 --> 00:14:03,759
Nor because I have many shoes.

414
00:14:03,760 --> 00:14:05,159
Just because I'm lazy.

415
00:14:05,160 --> 00:14:07,079
I like to talk slowly,

416
00:14:07,080 --> 00:14:08,920
