420
00:14:16,800 --> 00:14:19,719
But actually, I have a sensitive side too.

421
00:14:19,720 --> 00:14:21,679
Actually, I don't have much of a sense of security.

422
00:14:21,680 --> 00:14:23,639
I always trust myself more.

423
00:14:23,640 --> 00:14:26,399
