440
00:14:50,760 --> 00:14:52,680
Hello, teachers. My name is Wang Ruijian.

441
00:14:53,880 --> 00:14:55,240
You can call me Rui.

442
00:14:55,600 --> 00:14:58,239
Although I am the youngest among us,

443
00:14:58,240 --> 00:15:00,279
I'm a very clear-headed person.

444
00:15:00,280 --> 00:15:02,719
I know my goals very clearly.

445
00:15:02,720 --> 00:15:04,439
But actually, my biggest trait

446
00:15:04,440 --> 00:15:05,560
