447
00:15:05,920 --> 00:15:07,159
I'm invincible without makeup.

448
00:15:07,160 --> 00:15:08,160
Everyone knows that.

449
00:15:10,080 --> 00:15:11,959
Actually, the so-called narcissism I show

450
00:15:11,960 --> 00:15:13,960
