451
00:15:14,680 --> 00:15:16,439
It's a very hard

452
00:15:16,440 --> 00:15:18,680
and resilient shell.

453
00:15:19,160 --> 00:15:21,079
Because I'm sensitive inside too.

454
00:15:21,080 --> 00:15:22,279
I don't want others to see

455
00:15:22,280 --> 00:15:24,279
