456
00:15:24,280 --> 00:15:26,199
I'm a person with a lot of self-esteem.

457
00:15:26,200 --> 00:15:28,039
And I demand a lot of myself.

458
00:15:28,040 --> 00:15:30,639
He actually understands me more.

459
00:15:30,640 --> 00:15:32,279
Because my narcissism is probably more

460
00:15:32,280 --> 00:15:35,599
