What does you liking her have to do with me?

1121
00:37:44,720 --> 00:37:46,440
Why can only you like her?

1122
00:37:47,040 --> 00:37:48,320
If you like her, go for her.

1123
00:37:50,960 --> 00:37:51,960
Go.

1124
00:37:52,320 --> 00:37:54,359
You liked her in third grade?

1125
00:37:54,360 --> 00:37:55,080
Third grade?

1126
00:37:55,081 --> 00:37:56,239
Why didn't you get together with her?

1127
00:37:56,240 --> 00:37:56,680
So liking someone...

1128
00:37:56,680 --> 00:37:57,560
Why didn't you?

1129
00:37:57,561 --> 00:38:00,199
Isn't liking someone about a first come, first served?

1130
00:38:00,200 --> 00:38:01,000
And then?

1131
00:38:01,000 --> 00:38:01,480
Then...

1132
00:38:01,480 --> 00:38:02,160
I like her now.

1133
00:38:02,161 --> 00:38:03,320
So you're choosing her?

1134
00:38:05,960 --> 00:38:07,000
Just one question.

1135
00:38:07,880 --> 00:38:09,200
Are you backing off or not?

1136
00:38:10,720 --> 00:38:11,720
Like I give a damn.

1137
00:38:15,960 --> 00:38:17,160
Then don't give her anything.

1138
00:38:18,120 --> 00:38:19,160
I can buy more.

1139
00:38:19,600 --> 00:38:20,920
Someone like you...

1140
00:38:21,720 --> 00:38:22,840
So indecisive.

1141
00:38:22,960 --> 00:38:24,680
You'll just keep hiding forever.

1142
00:38:24,880 --> 00:38:26,439
If we ever break up,

1143
00:38:26,440 --> 00:38:27,480
then you can be with her.

1144
00:38:28,920 --> 00:38:29,960
Okay, stop.

1145
00:38:30,880 --> 00:38:32,399
Let's end this farce.

1146
00:38:32,400 --> 00:38:34,920
How did we both fall for Sun Mingyang?

1147
00:38:39,960 --> 00:38:41,280
They're all death-trap questions.

1148
00:38:42,800 --> 00:38:44,559
Thank goodness Miss Tian called cut.

1149
00:38:44,560 --> 00:38:46,319
Otherwise, if you kept acting,

1150
00:38:46,320 --> 00:38:47,839
it would loop forever.

1151
00:38:47,840 --> 00:38:48,919
If you broke the pattern a little more,

1152
00:38:48,920 --> 00:38:50,639
Miss Tian would give you more time.

1153
00:38:50,640 --> 00:38:51,759
Although, objectively speaking,

1154
00:38:51,760 --> 00:38:53,039
some parts were overacted.

1155
00:38:53,040 --> 00:38:54,759
That's hard to avoid.

1156
00:38:54,760 --> 00:38:56,159
But I can already feel

1157
00:38:56,160 --> 00:38:57,719
that you're deeply experiencing

1158
00:38:57,720 --> 00:38:59,319
this kind of layered construction

1159
00:38:59,320 --> 00:39:00,999
when the character's mood shifts.

1160
00:39:01,000 --> 00:39:02,160
It's still pretty tough.

1161
00:39:02,600 --> 00:39:03,600
That's pretty good.

1162
00:39:04,200 --> 00:39:05,200
Just now, there was a bit...

1163
00:39:05,201 --> 00:39:08,279
I didn't quite understand.

1164
00:39:08,280 --> 00:39:09,280
You see.

1165
00:39:09,720 --> 00:39:11,439
Xiaomeng, even though he's very tall himself,

1166
00:39:11,440 --> 00:39:13,639
he'd stand like this, very awkward.

1167
00:39:13,640 --> 00:39:16,039
Very sincere, with that kind of endearingly dorky vibe.

1168
00:39:16,040 --> 00:39:17,639
But when you first came up,

1169
00:39:17,640 --> 00:39:18,919
you were very outgoing.

1170
00:39:18,920 --> 00:39:20,159
I don't know why you would

1171
00:39:20,160 --> 00:39:21,839
add that design.

1172
00:39:21,840 --> 00:39:23,359
I'm also curious about that point.

1173
00:39:23,360 --> 00:39:25,479
The first impression he gave me was the same as what the teachers felt.

1174
00:39:25,480 --> 00:39:27,319
I thought he might be more...

1175
00:39:27,320 --> 00:39:28,399
I mean, even though he's very tall,

1176
00:39:28,400 --> 00:39:31,279
but the way he comes across is actually still quite like this.

1177
00:39:31,280 --> 00:39:33,559
But after spending time with him, I found he's so cute.

1178
00:39:33,560 --> 00:39:35,219
When we look in the mirror, we probably just do this.

1179
00:39:35,220 --> 00:39:36,639
When he looks in the mirror, he has to do this.

1180
00:39:36,640 --> 00:39:37,040
Just stares there.

1181
00:39:37,041 --> 00:39:38,079
Because he's tall, right?

1182
00:39:38,080 --> 00:39:39,599
And sometimes he's still quite...

1183
00:39:39,600 --> 00:39:42,359
just kind of handsome, I think.

1184
00:39:42,360 --> 00:39:44,119
So I amplified those traits of his.

1185
00:39:44,120 --> 00:39:45,399
Maybe at the time I thought...

1186
00:39:45,400 --> 00:39:46,400
Rhat's pretty good.

1187
00:39:47,080 --> 00:39:48,440
Thank you, teacher.

1188
00:39:49,120 --> 00:39:50,519
Actually, the feeling Xiaomeng gives me

1189
00:39:50,520 --> 00:39:51,839
is that among these eight people,

1190
00:39:51,840 --> 00:39:53,199
I think he's the hardest to imitate.

1191
00:39:53,200 --> 00:39:55,479
Everyone would think he doesn't talk much.

1192
00:39:55,480 --> 00:39:56,639
He gives off a bit of a cool, aloof vibe.

1193
00:39:56,640 --> 00:39:58,079
So there's a slight mature and distant feel.

1194
00:39:58,080 --> 00:40:01,359
But actually, when you really get to know Xiaomeng, you'll find

1195
00:40:01,360 --> 00:40:03,000
his personality is completely different.

1196
00:40:03,280 --> 00:40:05,360
The first core trait is that he's warm-hearted.

1197
00:40:05,600 --> 00:40:07,319
The second impression is that he's cocky.

1198
00:40:07,320 --> 00:40:08,800
It's basically quite consistent.

1199
00:40:10,600 --> 00:40:12,759
Because you all carry a dream

1200
00:40:12,760 --> 00:40:14,839
wanting to go down the path of acting.

1201
00:40:14,840 --> 00:40:16,399
This path is actually very hard to walk.

1202
00:40:16,400 --> 00:40:19,159
I hope everyone, during this summer camp,

1203
00:40:19,160 --> 00:40:22,479
keeps reflecting on your own true love for this industry.

1204
00:40:22,480 --> 00:40:24,239
Because I’ve read your materials.

1205
00:40:24,240 --> 00:40:26,079
Why each of you chose acting...

1206
00:40:26,080 --> 00:40:28,079
what you expressed is all a bit different.

1207
00:40:28,080 --> 00:40:29,919
So at this stage, that’s reasonable.

1208
00:40:29,920 --> 00:40:31,599
But as you go further,

1209
00:40:31,600 --> 00:40:34,319
we need to ask ourselves whether I truly love it.

1210
00:40:34,320 --> 00:40:36,279
And the industry needs new blood.

1211
00:40:36,280 --> 00:40:38,359
I hope you all keep your passion and keep going.

1212
00:40:38,360 --> 00:40:40,200
Thank you, teachers.

1213
00:40:40,640 --> 00:40:41,999
“Your” exam

1214
00:40:42,000 --> 00:40:43,559
ends here.

1215
00:40:43,560 --> 00:40:45,479
Then the scores

1216
00:40:45,480 --> 00:40:47,319
will be announced later, okay?

1217
00:40:47,320 --> 00:40:49,920
Okay, that’s all for today.

1218
00:40:50,520 --> 00:40:51,959
Thank you, teachers.

1219
00:40:51,960 --> 00:40:53,680
Thank you for your hard work, teachers.
